# Test data and config

Separate data from tests. Use typed models and builders. Switch environments via config (`ENV`, `BASE_URL`), not test edits. Support DEV/QA/UAT/STAGING/PROD as optional targets — do not assume all exist.

Never hardcode passwords, tokens, API keys, or environment URLs in source. Never commit `.env`. Use `.env.example` with empty placeholders only. Never log secrets.

```typescript
export interface Candidate {
  readonly firstName: string;
  readonly lastName: string;
  readonly email: string;
}
```
